claim.claim-text:
1. An ethylene polymer having:
a melt index (MI) in a range from 0.1 to 1 g/10 min and/or a high load melt index (HLMI) in a range from 10 to 80 g/10 min;
a density in a range from 0.93 to 0.96 g/cm3; and
a total film gel count of less than or equal to 40 gels per ft2 of 25 micron thick film, wherein film gels encompass a size in diameter of greater than 200 μm;
wherein the ethylene polymer contains:
from 150 to 680 ppm silica;
from 1.5 to 6.8 ppm chromium; and
from 1.5 to 40 ppm titanium.
